s=s.replace('No modeled calls.','Native work initializer,source query/commit/return/locks/remainder,format getter,range splitter and copy helpers also connected. No modeled calls. Independent whole256 work state and48-byte source reservation: commits returned header length and returns remainder if length<=4096, otherwise work preserved/reservation restored.')
